### 14\. Master V5 development directive

# AETHWYRD — UPGRADE V5
## ADVANCED COMBAT, ENEMY INTELLIGENCE & BATTLE SYSTEM EXPANSION

### PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Expand Aethwyrd into a sophisticated action combat experience with responsive controls, advanced enemy AI, weapon-specific combat, abilities, magic, boss encounters, tactical environments, and deep combat progression.

This upgrade must prioritize additions and improvements. Preserve existing working systems.

### 1. PROJECT DISCOVERY

- Inspect the current combat architecture.
- Identify existing player controllers, enemies, weapons, animations, abilities, and damage systems.
- Identify the game engine and its existing capabilities.
- Reuse existing systems wherever possible.
- Produce a technical implementation roadmap before making architectural changes.

### 2. COMBAT FRAMEWORK

