- Ability synergies.
- Cooldowns and resource management.

### 7. DAMAGE AND STATUS SYSTEM

Implement:

- Physical and elemental damage.
- Armor and resistances.
- Critical hits.
- Stagger and poise.
- Burn, freeze, poison, shock, and bleeding.
- Damage over time.
